    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Shop Simulator is an immersive first-person simulator where you step into the shoes of an ambitious entrepreneur, running a small but promising arcade shop. Your ultimate goal is to transform your humble establishment into the Ultimate Arcade Empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/cf88b27031ec3114c42a5ce38e51c63c.poster.avif?t=1754597659\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/cf88b27031ec3114c42a5ce38e51c63c.webm?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/cf88b27031ec3114c42a5ce38e51c63c.mp4?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection of arcade cabinets by scouting deals, haggling with sellers, and carefully weighing factors like condition, size, and game popularity. Open your doors to eager teenagers ready to play. Collect your earnings, and make strategic choices: should you invest in new machines or repair the one you already have?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/b3c84665b03967b4d236a98ce4f56e72.poster.avif?t=1754597659\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/b3c84665b03967b4d236a98ce4f56e72.webm?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/b3c84665b03967b4d236a98ce4f56e72.mp4?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But running an arcade isn\u2019t all fun and games! Keep your shop spotless and welcoming to earn good reviews and boost your reputation. A higher reputation means more traffic and higher profits.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/593234d401fcbc27e3f41c94373557fd.poster.avif?t=1754597659\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/593234d401fcbc27e3f41c94373557fd.webm?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/593234d401fcbc27e3f41c94373557fd.mp4?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your business to the next level by upgrading your tools. Fix machines faster, clean more efficiently with a vacuum cleaner, and automate cash transfer with wireless money collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/d1dc68d26964a76767362b1d2b9543d5.poster.avif?t=1754597659\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/d1dc68d26964a76767362b1d2b9543d5.webm?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/d1dc68d26964a76767362b1d2b9543d5.mp4?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and personalize your arcade shop! Purchase decorations and furniture to give your shop a one-of-a-kind vibe that\u2019ll wow your customers and enhance your reputation. And when your current space can't handle the hype, expand your empire by buying additional floorspace and making room for even more epic arcade experiences.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/aadbbf37c719e1f4c7ecb2654db4ac12.poster.avif?t=1754597659\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/aadbbf37c719e1f4c7ecb2654db4ac12.webm?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/aadbbf37c719e1f4c7ecb2654db4ac12.mp4?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build the arcade of your dreams and dominate the world of gaming? <br><br>Add Arcade Shop Simulator to Wishlist today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Shop Simulator is an immersive first-person simulator where you step into the shoes of an ambitious entrepreneur, running a small but promising arcade shop. Your ultimate goal is to transform your humble establishment into the Ultimate Arcade Empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/cf88b27031ec3114c42a5ce38e51c63c.poster.avif?t=1754597659\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/cf88b27031ec3114c42a5ce38e51c63c.webm?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/cf88b27031ec3114c42a5ce38e51c63c.mp4?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection of arcade cabinets by scouting deals, haggling with sellers, and carefully weighing factors like condition, size, and game popularity. Open your doors to eager teenagers ready to play. Collect your earnings, and make strategic choices: should you invest in new machines or repair the one you already have?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/b3c84665b03967b4d236a98ce4f56e72.poster.avif?t=1754597659\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/b3c84665b03967b4d236a98ce4f56e72.webm?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421710/extras/b3c84665b03967b4d236a98ce4f56e72.mp4?t=1754597659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But running an arcade isn\u2019t al